[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 71 He's awful!",
    "start": 0.73,
    "end": 4.57,
    "zh": "第71课 他真讨厌!",
    "zh_hant": "第71課 他真討厭!"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 5.81,
    "end": 10.671,
    "zh": "听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "How did Pauline answer the telephone",
    "start": 11.736,
    "end": 15.578,
    "zh": "波琳是如何接电话的",
    "zh_hant": "波琳是如何接電話的"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "at nine o'clock?",
    "start": 15.578,
    "end": 17.299,
    "zh": "在九点钟时？",
    "zh_hant": "在九點鐘時？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What's Ron Marston like, Pauline?",
    "start": 19.62,
    "end": 23.282,
    "zh": "罗恩·马斯顿怎么样，波琳？",
    "zh_hant": "羅恩·馬斯頓怎麼樣，波琳？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "He's awful!",
    "start": 24.062,
    "end": 26.183,
    "zh": "他太讨厌了！",
    "zh_hant": "他太討厭了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "He telephoned me four times yesterday",
    "start": 26.583,
    "end": 30.945,
    "zh": "他昨天给我打了四次电话",
    "zh_hant": "他昨天給我打了四次電話"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "and three times the day",
    "start": 31.186,
    "end": 34.287,
    "zh": "还打了三次",
    "zh_hant": "還打了三次"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "before yesterday.",
    "start": 33.937,
    "end": 35.848,
    "zh": "在前天。",
    "zh_hant": "在前天。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "He telephoned the office",
    "start": 37.169,
    "end": 40.01,
    "zh": "他打了办公室的电话",
    "zh_hant": "他打了辦公室的電話"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "yesterday morning",
    "start": 39.871,
    "end": 41.691,
    "zh": "昨天上午",
    "zh_hant": "昨天上午"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "and yesterday afternoon.",
    "start": 41.712,
    "end": 44.973,
    "zh": "和昨天下午。",
    "zh_hant": "和昨天下午。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "My boss answered the telephone.",
    "start": 45.533,
    "end": 48.895,
    "zh": "我的老板接了电话。",
    "zh_hant": "我的老闆接了電話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "What did your boss say to him?",
    "start": 50.036,
    "end": 52.797,
    "zh": "你老板对他说了什么？",
    "zh_hant": "你老闆對他說了什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "He said, 'Pauline",
    "start": 53.778,
    "end": 56.419,
    "zh": "他说：‘波琳",
    "zh_hant": "他說：‘波琳"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "is typing letters.",
    "start": 56.219,
    "end": 58.32,
    "zh": "正在打信件。",
    "zh_hant": "正在打信件。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "She can't speak to you now!'",
    "start": 58.54,
    "end": 61.561,
    "zh": "她现在不能和你说话！’",
    "zh_hant": "她現在不能和你說話！’"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Then I arrived home",
    "start": 62.422,
    "end": 64.963,
    "zh": "然后我回到家",
    "zh_hant": "然後我回到家"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "at six o'clock yesterday evening.",
    "start": 64.683,
    "end": 68.345,
    "zh": "在昨晚六点钟。",
    "zh_hant": "在昨晚六點鐘。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "He telephoned again.",
    "start": 68.745,
    "end": 71.206,
    "zh": "他又打来电话。",
    "zh_hant": "他又打來電話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "But I didn't answer the phone!",
    "start": 71.506,
    "end": 74.628,
    "zh": "但我没有接电话！",
    "zh_hant": "但我沒有接電話！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Did he telephone again last night?",
    "start": 75.588,
    "end": 79.05,
    "zh": "他昨晚又打电话了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "他昨晚又打電話了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Yes, he did.",
    "start": 79.812,
    "end": 81.853,
    "zh": "是的，他打了。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，他打了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "He telephoned at nine o'clock.",
    "start": 82.113,
    "end": 85.495,
    "zh": "他在九点钟打的电话。",
    "zh_hant": "他在九點鐘打的電話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "What did you say to him?",
    "start": 86.376,
    "end": 88.658,
    "zh": "你对他说了什么？",
    "zh_hant": "你對他說了什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "I said, 'This is Pauline's mother.",
    "start": 89.779,
    "end": 93.681,
    "zh": "我说：‘我是波琳的母亲。",
    "zh_hant": "我說：‘我是波琳的母親。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Please don't telephone my daughter",
    "start": 93.742,
    "end": 97.364,
    "zh": "请不要给我的女儿打电话",
    "zh_hant": "請不要給我的女兒打電話"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "again!'",
    "start": 97.144,
    "end": 98.545,
    "zh": "了！’",
    "zh_hant": "了！’"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "Did he telephone again?",
    "start": 99.366,
    "end": 101.707,
    "zh": "他又打电话了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "他又打電話了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "No, he didn't!",
    "start": 102.148,
    "end": 104.87,
    "zh": "没有，他没打！",
    "zh_hant": "沒有，他沒打！"
  }
]
